<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Patch>
  <!--
    Tags VFEP's warcasket slugthrower for the man in black's kind (Defs/PawnKindDefs/
    StrangerInBlack_Medic.xml): vanilla's weapon generation picks by weaponTags, and the
    slugthrower's own tags (WarcasketAll, WarcasketVeteran) are shared with the other warcasket
    guns, so a tag of ours on this one def is what makes the pick deterministic. Ungated: VFEP
    is a hard dependency, so the def is always there and a renamed one would log a patch error
    at every boot, which is why Tests/1.6/CompatPatchTests.cs expects no main-tree hit for it.
    Combat Extended's own patch on the gun (PatchOperationMakeGunCECompatible) adds no tags of
    its own to this one and replaces none, so the tag survives CE in either load order.
  -->
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationAdd">
    <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName = "VFEP_WarcasketGun_Slugthrower"]/weaponTags</xpath>
    <value>
      <li>MDWC_StrangerInBlack</li>
    </value>
  </Operation>
</Patch>
